# Intentfile — North-star for developer-ecosystem
# Author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>

@abstract:
Committed next-actions and horizon aspirations for the developer-ecosystem monorepo.
Intents are concrete and verifiable; wishes are directional and non-gating.
@end

## Committed Next-Actions

### migrate-rescript-to-affinescript
- description: Complete migration of rescript-evangeliser and rescript-ecosystem satellite tools to AffineScript per CLAUDE.md policy (issue #488 pattern)
- probe: test -z "$(find . -name '*.res' -not -path '*/.git/*' -not -path '*/node_modules/*' 2>/dev/null | head -1)"
- status: declared
- target-date: 2026-12-31
- notes: Blocked on AffineScript toolchain maturity. Use tools/res-to-affine/ migration assistant when ready.

### complete-contractiles-tridents
- description: Promote all 6 verb dirs to full tridents (add .k9.ncl + .manifest.a2ml for must/trust/bust/dust)
- probe: test -f .machine_readable/contractiles/must/must.k9.ncl && test -f .machine_readable/contractiles/trust/trust.k9.ncl
- status: in_progress
- notes: .ncl runners added 2026-06-05 currency checkpoint. k9.ncl + manifests deferred (TASK spec scope).

### 6a2-refresh-currency
- description: Keep 6a2/ STATE.a2ml/META.a2ml/ECOSYSTEM.a2ml current with each major session
- probe: grep -q '2026' .machine_readable/6a2/STATE.a2ml
- status: in_progress
- notes: Last refreshed 2026-06-05 (currency checkpoint session).

### bot-directives-rename-subrepos
- description: Rename agent_instructions/ → bot_directives/ in all satellite .machine_readable/ dirs (iser-tools, rescript-ecosystem, v-ecosystem, affinescript-ecosystem subrepos)
- probe: "! find . -path '*/.machine_readable/agent_instructions' -type d 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep -q ."
- status: declared
- notes: Root .machine_readable/ already correct. Satellite subrepo directories have their own agent_instructions/ dirs needing git mv. Deferred — each subrepo is a separate project tree.

## Horizon Aspirations

### zig-api-phase3
- description: Complete zig-api Phase 3 — full codegen coverage and upstream contribution
- horizon: mid
- why: The Zig ecosystem is growing rapidly; early contribution establishes hyperpolymath as a core contributor.
- status: declared

### git-hud-production
- description: Ship git-hud as a production-quality unified forge dashboard
- horizon: mid
- why: git-hud unifies GitHub + GitLab + Gitea into one interface — high daily-driver value.
- status: declared

### oikos-carbon-scoring
- description: Deploy oikos ecological code analysis to all ~290 hyperpolymath repos
- horizon: far
- why: Estate-wide carbon intensity and sustainability scoring is a differentiator.
- status: declared

### affinescript-estate-primary
- description: Make AffineScript the primary application language across all developer-ecosystem satellites (completing the policy refresh)
- horizon: far
- why: ReScript is legacy as of 2026-05-25 policy. AffineScript is the go-forward.
- status: declared
